Narrative ID: aa42e210a361571ff4d1fad892b75d15
Narrative: How can a device avoid futile access attempts while still selecting connectivity for best throughput?

Maximum answer sentences: 5

Each evidence sentence below has an evidence_id. Use those evidence_ids to indicate which sentences support each answer sentence.

Evidence:
[
  {
    "evidence_id": 0,
    "doc_id": "275699672",
    "text": "While studies have examined the influence of learning/attentional difficulties (LAD) and ethnicity on educational attainment in higher education separately, few have explored their interaction."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 1,
    "doc_id": "122371639",
    "text": "APPLYING DEEP LEARNING IN USER EQUIPMENT MEASURABLE KPIs TO AVOID UNNECESSARY NR RACH PROCEDURES Abstract A user equipment (UE) in a wireless communication network uses a deep learning network model to infer whether a Fifth Generation (5G) New Radio (NR) random-access channel (RACH) failure is."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 2,
    "doc_id": "275699915",
    "text": "To address those issues, we conducted a machine learning mega-analysis on 803 PTSD patients who received a form of exposure therapy, with the aim to predict who will later discontinue treatment."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 3,
    "doc_id": "122371639",
    "text": "The UE implements the trained deep learning network model to infer whether an NR RACH failure is likely to occur based on the features, such as the measurable 4G/5G KPIs, at the current location so that the UE can avoid triggering an NR RACH procedure."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 4,
    "doc_id": "275699672",
    "text": "To do this, we analysed data from all 3.7 million UK students awarded a classified first degree between 2008/09 and 2019/20."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 5,
    "doc_id": "122371639",
    "text": "4460 [2021] https://www.tdcommons.org/dpubs_series/4460 UE is able to make the best decision to avoid the unnecessary NR RACH procedure."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 6,
    "doc_id": "275699915",
    "text": "Although several types of evidence-based exposure therapies have been recognized as first line interventions for PTSD, high dropout rates remain of critical concern and are a significant barrier towards recovery."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 7,
    "doc_id": "275699672",
    "text": "Students with LAD were less likely to achieve first-class or upper second-class degrees than were students with no reported difficulties although the difference was small."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 8,
    "doc_id": "122371639",
    "text": "As such, if the UE encounters incorrect or non-optimized configurations for a cell within the network, the UE still attempts to connect with the cell according to the procedures defined in the 3GPP specification."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 9,
    "doc_id": "122371639",
    "text": "Description As described in detail below, a deep learning mechanism is integrated into the modem of a UE to detect and avoid potential NR RACH failures."
  }
]

